<p>
  Shared state is a <code>Y.Array</code> of row <code>Y.Map</code>s, and every
  cell is its own <code>Y.Map</code> of <code>{ value, bold, fill }</code>.
  Edits to different cells merge. Edits to different properties of the same
  cell merge too: bold a cell while someone else is typing in it and both
  changes land. If two people set the same property, the last write wins.
  Values commit on Enter or blur, like a spreadsheet.
</p>
<p>
  Sorting and column order come from TanStack Table and stay out of the
  document. They're local to your window. Sort by Owner in one window and by
  Qty in the other, then edit the same cell in both.
</p>
